WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:09.176
The first six major arcana cards, from The Fool to The
Hierophant, with upright meanings and a short note on reversals.

00:00:10.476 --> 00:00:14.574
The Fool stands for new beginnings, trust,
openness and risk.

00:00:15.874 --> 00:00:20.309
The Magician stands for skill, focus,
resourcefulness and action.

00:00:21.609 --> 00:00:26.822
The High Priestess stands for intuition,
stillness, the unspoken and inner knowing.

00:00:28.122 --> 00:00:32.812
The Empress stands for nurture, abundance,
creativity and comfort.

00:00:34.212 --> 00:00:36.632
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:36.632 --> 00:00:41.538
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
